{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Miles is a driving experience that lets you enjoy the freedom of the open road. Designed for players who crave the feeling of\u00a0driving endlessly, drifting on winding roads or just going off the beaten path to climb the highest peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Drive for miles:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no better feeling than just hopping into your car of choice and just going for a drive. Just beware, the faster ones have a tendency to spin so be careful with the throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/9345b60bc6b7e2e51da126c7ea1edec5.poster.avif?t=1754421419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/9345b60bc6b7e2e51da126c7ea1edec5.webm?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/9345b60bc6b7e2e51da126c7ea1edec5.mp4?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Drift for miles:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have an itch to go sideways? Hop into the DR-01 or the DR-02, cars setup just for drifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/a5b1714381950e9c9936d31edd2e52cf.poster.avif?t=1754421419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/a5b1714381950e9c9936d31edd2e52cf.webm?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/a5b1714381950e9c9936d31edd2e52cf.mp4?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore for miles:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Had enough of the roads? Well, hop into the TU-01 and explore the vast landscapes. Blast through the desert, climb the highest peak in Vista Plateau or avoid the rocks in the tundra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/1e21584b05a68ab2d4c230ace4e791af.poster.avif?t=1754421419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/1e21584b05a68ab2d4c230ace4e791af.webm?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/extras/1e21584b05a68ab2d4c230ace4e791af.mp4?t=1754421419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the drive!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751980?t=1754421419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751980?t=1754421419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/40d0d660eaaa783a56d6e96efabc4e654c605ae8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754421419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751980/40d0d660eaaa783a56d6e96efabc4e654c605ae8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754421419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Miles is a driving experience that lets you enjoy the freedom of the open 